Muse Spark Open Kernel Challenge 2026, serving-track entry

The file patch/okc-serving.diff is a patch against SGLang
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang) at commit 297e54fd (v0.5.23), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The patch adds new files and
edits existing SGLang files. Context and removed lines in the diff are SGLang's;
added lines are ours. Each new file carries an SPDX header, and each edited
SGLang file carries a "Modified 2026" line.

No SGLang source tree, model weights, judge code or third-party kernel code is
included in this repository.
